WEBVTT

00:00:00.568 --> 00:00:01.230
Hi there!

00:00:01.366 --> 00:00:03.550
At the end of the month, accountants often ask:

00:00:03.792 --> 00:00:06.750
what was this card payment for, and where's the receipt?

00:00:07.099 --> 00:00:08.510
Tositeo answers for you.

00:00:09.002 --> 00:00:10.349
Import your bank statement,

00:00:10.299 --> 00:00:13.230
and every payment is matched with its receipt automatically.

00:00:13.532 --> 00:00:16.501
You see right away which payments still have no receipt,

00:00:16.451 --> 00:00:18.430
and Tositeo reminds the right person.

00:00:18.936 --> 00:00:23.649
First, go to your online bank, open the account statement, choose the period,

00:00:23.599 --> 00:00:25.466
and download it as a CSV file,

00:00:25.582 --> 00:00:27.386
or another format your bank offers.

00:00:27.693 --> 00:00:29.226
Banks in every country work.

00:00:29.635 --> 00:00:33.466
In Tositeo, open Bank & card, and click Import a statement.

00:00:33.893 --> 00:00:37.678
Enter the account or card name, choose the file you just downloaded,

00:00:37.628 --> 00:00:38.666
then click Import.

00:00:39.206 --> 00:00:42.197
Tositeo tells you how many transactions were imported.

00:00:42.541 --> 00:00:46.757
Rows that were already there are skipped, so importing twice does no harm.

00:00:47.256 --> 00:00:48.917
Every payment has a status.

00:00:49.181 --> 00:00:50.917
Matched means it has a receipt.

00:00:51.185 --> 00:00:53.077
Receipt missing means it doesn't yet.

00:00:53.427 --> 00:00:56.096
Incoming money, like a payment from a customer,

00:00:56.046 --> 00:00:58.437
is marked No receipt needed automatically.

00:00:59.001 --> 00:01:03.177
Click the Receipt missing tab to see only the payments still missing a receipt.

00:01:03.526 --> 00:01:05.817
For each one, you have two choices.

00:01:06.086 --> 00:01:09.817
Click Add receipt, to snap the receipt for exactly this payment.

00:01:10.073 --> 00:01:13.340
Or click No receipt needed, for example for bank fees,

00:01:13.290 --> 00:01:16.377
or transfers between two of the company's accounts.

00:01:17.006 --> 00:01:19.949
When you click Add receipt, the Add receipt page opens,

00:01:19.899 --> 00:01:23.422
with a line showing which payment this receipt will be matched to.

00:01:23.890 --> 00:01:27.502
The date, the merchant and the amount are already filled in from the bank.

00:01:27.851 --> 00:01:31.182
You just snap the receipt, choose the expense type, and send it.

00:01:31.733 --> 00:01:34.881
The Matched tab shows each payment together with its receipt.

00:01:35.191 --> 00:01:37.841
If something was matched wrongly, click Unmatch.

00:01:38.109 --> 00:01:40.481
Receipts added later are matched automatically.

00:01:40.670 --> 00:01:44.721
Or click Match again, so Tositeo checks everything again from the start.

00:01:45.395 --> 00:01:48.731
If someone paid by card and hasn't handed in the receipt,

00:01:48.681 --> 00:01:50.576
Tositeo e-mails them a reminder,

00:01:50.680 --> 00:01:53.296
after the number of days you chose in Company settings.

00:01:53.617 --> 00:01:56.656
To remind them right now, click Send reminder now.

00:01:57.015 --> 00:01:58.343
At the end of the month,

00:01:58.293 --> 00:02:01.856
click Monthly summary CSV to download a table for your accountant.

00:02:02.125 --> 00:02:03.616
Now take the quiz below.
